  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Wait a while for some WebSocket connection problems to occur\n\n3. Open the WebSocket debug view\n\nThe recent events in the attached image are rather confusing - the latest event is a Close, but the connection is open and working fine as seen at the top of the window. I suspect the Close event might be for an older connection that was given up on before starting the new connection a064a2f8.\n\nI suggest including some kind of connection ID as a separate column to make the log clearer.",
